WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Ryu starts Drive Impact against Ken's incoming Drive Impact.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.700
Ryu's Drive Impact hits with the black-and-white punish-counter effect.

3
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.200
Ryu follows the crumpling opponent into the normal-attack sequence.

4
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.400
Ryu connects the close medium-punch follow-up.

5
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.600
Ryu begins the Shoryuken finish under Ken.

6
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.400
Ken falls after the meterless DP follow-up.
